          <li>Bithiah's Outstanding Volunteer (2024)</li>
          <li>2024 Hacienda All-League Scholar Athlete</li>
          <li>WHS ASB Most Valuable Member (2024)</li>
          <li>WHS Track &amp; Field Third Year Award</li>
          <li>2023 National Hispanic Recognition (College Board)</li>
          <li>WHS ASB Rookie of the Year (2023)</li>
          <li>1st Place, 2022 Walnut Valley Water District Media Contest</li>
          <li>Finalist, 2021 Rose Parade D&iacute;a de los Muertos Art Competition</li>
